    "id": "p6-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "A bag contains 11 balls. Three of these are black and eight are blue. A ball is taken from the bag at random. What is the probability that it is blue?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{8}{11}$",
      "worked": "There are 8 blue balls among 11 balls, and each ball is equally likely to be selected.\n\n$$P(\\text{blue})=\\frac{8}{11}.$$",
